    | quadratic, as P2 shipped it | 579108 | 644288 |
    | stable `sort_by` | 584348 | 649488 |
    | unstable `sort_unstable_by`, committed | 584164 | 649304 |
    
    The committed form costs 5016 section bytes over the quadratic one in
    `probe-emend-edit`, and 184 fewer than the stable sort.
